Package: hdcrtRepro
Type: Package
Title: Reproducibility Materials for High-Dimensional Censored Transformation Model Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Anonymous", "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "anonymous@example.com")
Description: Provides utility functions and benchmark implementations used to reproduce
    the simulation studies and real data analysis for hypothesis testing in
    high-dimensional censored transformation models. The package includes functions
    for data generation under different censoring mechanisms, construction of
    simulation settings, summary of empirical size and power, plotting of simulation
    results, and auxiliary benchmark tests.
